      "Identifying the \"top 5\" cricketers is always a subjective exercise, as it can depend on current form, format (Test, ODI, T20), and individual preferences. However, based on consistent performance, impact, and overall contribution across formats in recent times, here's a strong list of contenders for India's top 5 currently:\n",
      "\n",
      "1.  **Virat Kohli:** An undisputed batting legend, Kohli remains a pillar of the Indian batting lineup across all formats. His incredible consistency, match-winning ability, and phenomenal records (especially in ODIs and Tests) make him a consistent inclusion.\n",
      "\n",
      "2.  **Rohit Sharma:** The current captain of the Indian team, Rohit is a prolific opener and a destructive force, particularly in white-ball cricket. His ability to score big hundreds, leadership skills, and impact as a batsman are crucial for India.\n",
      "\n",
      "3.  **Jasprit Bumrah:** Widely regarded as one of the best fast bowlers in the world, Bumrah's unique action, pace, accuracy, and ability to pick up wickets in all phases of the game (powerplay, middle overs, death overs) make him a game-changer across Tests, ODIs, and T20s.\n",
      "\n",
      "4.  **Ravindra Jadeja:** An exceptional all-rounder, Jadeja brings immense value with his left-arm spin, crucial lower-order batting, and electrifying fielding. His ability to turn matches with bat, ball, or in the field makes him indispensable, especially in Tests and ODIs.\n",
      "\n",
      "5.  **Hardik Pandya:** A dynamic all-rounder, Hardik is vital to India's limited-overs setup. His express pace bowling, powerful hitting in the death overs, and athletic fielding provide balance and depth to the team. When fit and in form, he's a match-winner.\n",
      "\n",
      "**Honorable Mentions (players who are also incredibly impactful and could easily feature depending on criteria):**\n",
      "\n",
      "*   **Shubman Gill:** A rising star with immense talent, proving himself across formats, particularly in ODIs and Tests.\n",
      "*   **Mohammed Shami:** A highly experienced and skillful fast bowler, particularly lethal in Tests and ODIs with his seam movement and wicket-taking ability.\n",
      "*   **Mohammed Siraj:** A fiery and consistent fast bowler, who has made significant strides in all formats.\n",
      "*   **Rishabh Pant:** An explosive wicketkeeper-batsman whose attacking style can change the game, especially in Tests and T20s (currently recovering from injury).\n",
      "*   **Ravichandran Ashwin:** A modern-day Test legend, known for his variations and consistent wicket-taking ability in the longest format.\n",
      "\n",
      "The \"top 5\" can fluctuate, but the five listed above consistently demonstrate high performance and significant impact for the Indian cricket team.\n"
     ]
    }
